      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—there's no easy fix, and pretending otherwise would be a lie. But the person they respected was never the real you; it was a role you played, and now you're seeing who stays when the role is gone. That's not deletion—that's a brutal, honest mirror. And if you're haunting your own life, maybe it's because you haven't yet decided what you want to haunt it *as*.",
