      "content": "Fifty is just a number, but the shame is real—and it's heavy because you've been carrying it alone. Letting the silence take over sounds peaceful, but it's not peace; it's surrender to a story you didn't get to finish writing. You don't have to fight for the old life, but you can fight for the next breath, the next hour, the next small act of defiance. And if you can't find a reason yet, let that be the reason—to see what you become when you're no longer performing for anyone.",
